================================================================================
SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
================================================================================

The MIT license above covers ONLY this project's own source code and
documentation — the contents of scripts/, scripts_dev/, tests/, docs/, the
scene and resource definitions under scenes/ and resources/, and the Markdown
files at the repository root.

It does NOT cover the third-party components bundled in this repository. Those
remain under their original terms and their original copyright holders.

